OL,3,GNEWSAA14 reopens after lorry fire
OL,4,
OL,5,FA section of the A14 in Suffolk that
OL,6,Fwas closed after a lorry fire during
OL,7,FThursday morning's rush hour finally
OL,8,Freopened in the early hours of Friday.
OL,10,FThe incident happened just before 08:00
OL,11,FGMT between junctions 50 and 51, for
OL,12,FNeedham Market and Stowmarket.
OL,14,FMotorists were temporarily held in both
OL,15,Fdirections between the junctions, but
OL,16,Fthe westbound carriageway reopened on
OL,17,FThursday morning.
OL,19,FThe eastbound carriageway remained
OL,20,Fclosed, but National Highways posted on
OL,21,FX that it was reopened at about 02:15
OL,22,Fon Friday.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
